{"version":1,"content":"<p>一羣瀕臨滅絕的巨型海龜正在厄瓜多爾海岸展現出令人意外的生存跡象。研究人員發現，東太平洋稜皮龜在2025至2026年的繁殖季中，於厄瓜多爾多處海灘創下築巢數量紀錄。這一現象出現在距離它們傳統築巢地墨西哥和哥斯達黎加超過一千英裏的地方，為這個已減少逾九成的極危種羣帶來了潛在轉機。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587312.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:04:29.241158+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:55:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:39.011343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:39.011343+00:00","content_hash":"854339bf39f6189f183601f52c3f6c046bd530256dab0e9f0bfd5791e31718d8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}